## Citation

TRACE-Omics was developed as part of doctoral research at Stellenbosch University.

If you use or adapt this repository, please acknowledge the software and its author.

**Suggested software acknowledgement:**

Ehlers, A. (2026). *TRACE-Omics: A framework for robust and generalisable transcriptomic machine learning*. GitHub repository. https://github.com/AshleyPy/trace-omics

A formal dissertation citation, publication reference or archived software DOI may be added when available.

